<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">League of the Ten Jurisdictions</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1436">1436</a>–<a href="/years/1799">1799</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/15th-century">15th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The League of the Ten Jurisdictions was an alliance of communities in north-eastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/graubunden">Graubünden</a>, formed in 1436 after the death of the last Count of Toggenburg. With the League of God's House and the Grey League it made up the Three Leagues, the Free State of the Grisons, an ally of the Swiss Confederation. It lasted until the French invasion of 1799.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/league-of-the-ten-jurisdictions.jpg" alt="League of the Ten Jurisdictions" width="320" height="299" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Marco Zanoli (sidonius 15:49, 30 June 2006 (UTC)) · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Trois_ligues.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
